  "title": "Baked Italian Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "These Italian chicken thighs are baked with ricotta, Parmesan, mozzarella, and marinara sauce for a tasty weeknight meal perfect served with pasta.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
